    kind: work_item  # 7067
    title: "entrypoint ranking: routes saturate at rank_score 1.0, so the entrypoint cap and the sketch pick routes by insertion order (thc: Express /scan,/health crowded out by Phoenix routes)"  # 7067
    status: todo_hard  # 7067
    priority: 3  # 7067
